            </div>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#CBD5E1]">
              {hasDialablePhone
                ? `Zero upfront payment is due today. Tap below to open a pre-filled text message directly to ${prospect.businessName}.`
                : `Zero upfront payment is due today. Copy your quote summary below and message ${prospect.instagramHandle} directly for faster confirmation.`}
            </p>
            <div class="mt-3.5 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5">
              {hasDialablePhone ? (
